(7814161, 1305341, 12200, '<td valign="top">
The depth of this image is really conveyed by its intersecting planes of layers. You have the vertical layering of foreground, horizon, and sky, of course. But then there''s also the lateral layering of shoreline and cascading tide, plus the depth layering of the shore and hillsides along the vanishing point. Supremely well seen for this challenge.</td>', 'The depth of this image is really conveyed by its intersecting planes of layers. You have the vertical layering of foreground, horizon, and sky, of course. But then there''s also the lateral layering of shoreline and cascading tide, plus the depth layering of the shore and hillsides along the vanishing point. Supremely well seen for this challenge.', '2026-04-07 05:29:44.000000', NULL, 0),
